+// ============================ RetroMac themed chrome ============================
+// When RetroMac hosts this engine under a retro theme (RETROMAC_THEME), the borderless game
+// window gets a themed title bar ("chrome") drawn INSIDE it. The bar occupies the top
+// RetroMacChromeH *logical* rows; the game / movie / menu picture is copied into the viewport
+// BELOW it. Every present funnels through RetroMacPresent(), which guarantees the chrome is
+// (re)drawn last, immediately before the flip — so no render path can leave it stale. In
+// fullscreen the chrome is switched off atomically (RetroMacChromeH == 0 → picture fills the
